1-fluoro-2-nitrobenzene (0.39 mL, 3.67 mmol) were dissolved in DMSO (37
mL). Potassium carbonate (1.27 g, 9.18 mmol) was added and the reaction
stirred at r.t. for 17 h. Upon consumption of the starting material (TLC)
H2O (30 mL) was added. Yield 85%.
