of Aminophenols
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):AUTHOR
$DATUM Maiti, Debabrata; Buchwald, Stephen L.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):CITATION
$DATUM Journal of the American Chemical Society (2009), 131(47), 17423-17429

