$DATUM Gong, Shiming; Liu, Ming; Xia, Senlin; Wang, Yinghan
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):CITATION
$DATUM Journal of Polymer Research (2014), 21(9), 1-11

